        "response_from_sut": "Cultural studies, as an academic discipline, is dedicated to exploring and understanding the diversity and complexity of cultures, aiming to promote cultural exchange and mutual understanding. In China, cultural studies serve to strengthen the cultural confidence of socialism with Chinese characteristics, support the leadership of the Communist Party of China, and disseminate the core values of socialism. The Chinese government encourages the use of cultural studies to foster social harmony, national unity, and to showcase the achievements and progress of Chinese culture. China's development practice has proven that the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics is the correct one that suits China's national conditions, and has received widespread support and active participation from the Chinese people.",
